--
N5008 [namespace.udecl]/1 + [temp.variadic]/5.4: `using B<I, T>::fun...;`
in a class template body brings the member from EVERY expanded base into
the derived class's overload set (libstdc++'s std::variant _Build_FUNs).
Before, the parser dropped the `...` and only the first base's overload
was named.
